    X∫|ψq_θ|² − O(X/Y) + o(X) (Plancherel on R, plus the tail of a smooth transform).
  - The windows are disjoint for distinct θ, so Bessel gives Σ_θ ∫ψ²|q_θ|² <= ∫ψ²p. Since ψ is arbitrary, the
