272:PROVED artifact map. moment_gap.py/json is the shortest exact arithmetic certificate for the strongest theorem. envelope_exact.py/json and constants_exact.json verify the earlier CF proof independently. witness.py and witness_B48.json give all rational nodal data, exact PD and all-scale window checks. summary.json contains compact numerical tables; manifest.json contains software versions and source hashes. adversarial_sets.json, realized_sets.json, their checks, realized_construction.json and point_certificates.json preserve every notable finite set and certificate. All paths are inside tdense7_scratch. The abandoned staircase model and its infeasible result are retained with their stated limitation.

